      "id": "claim_0a298dc3037e406c9dfc918015cd2cfa",
      "statement": "Open SWE hosts agent, reviewer, and review-scout runs on the single Managed Deep Agents graph `open-swe`; MDA owns the model loop, checkpoints, tool calls, sandbox, and surrounding middleware while the backend plans the run and supplies credentialed/data-backed behavior through typed APIs.",
